      "id": "import",
      "title": "Import",
      "members": [],
      "paragraphs": [
        "A mutable value that notifies its subscribers when it changes.",
        "```ts const health = new Observable(100); const status = health.map(hp => (hp > 50 ? 'Healthy' : 'Wounded'));",
        "health.value -= 60; // status subscribers receive 'Wounded' ```",
        "Assigning value notifies only when the new value differs by `Object.is`, so repeated equal assignments cost a comparison and nothing else. An object mutated in place keeps its identity and therefore needs markChanged or mutate to notify. Primitive assignments allocate nothing; a listener throwing aborts the remaining listeners of that notification and propagates to the assignment."
      ],
      "importLine": "import { Observable } from '@codexo/exojs'",
      "sourceLink": null
